WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.558
Our Castle turns a shared family savings goal into a growing woodland realm.

00:00:04.678 --> 00:00:06.547
This tour uses example mode.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.304
The next action follows the family’s saved progress.

00:00:11.424 --> 00:00:15.883
Choose your house, review a weekly plan, then choose a contribution.

00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:21.157
Opening a step never pays, accepts a plan, or asks the AI automatically.

00:00:21.277 --> 00:00:23.507
The family decides when to continue.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.535
A real Claude planning request, recorded earlier in the previous interface.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.644
Review the editable plan.

00:00:33.764 --> 00:00:37.027
Eight thirty-dollar weeks fill the two hundred forty dollar gap.

00:00:37.147 --> 00:00:39.062
Each payment needs adult approval.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:47.719
The historical verifier separately checked a feasible plan and a one hundred sixty dollar shortfall.

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:49.813
The server rechecks the arithmetic.

00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:52.859
Reported starting progress is not a bank balance.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:58.024
Here, the family reviews fifteen dollars and the next milestone.

00:00:58.144 --> 00:00:59.781
An adult approves the amount.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:03.779
This contribution is simulated; no PayPal payment is made.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:10.837
A separate historical sandbox test used PayPal’s hosted approval page.

00:01:10.957 --> 00:01:17.575
It verified a fifteen dollar capture, rejected duplicate credit and household mismatch, then refunded it.

00:01:17.695 --> 00:01:19.633
This report is not a new checkout.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:27.174
The example contribution raises tracked progress from sixty to seventy five dollars.

00:01:27.294 --> 00:01:29.256
The Manor bridge lowers across the river.

00:01:29.376 --> 00:01:33.277
The village stays, and Princess Elowen joins the Manor’s guests.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:41.258
Refresh; the simulated payment stays in the Ledger.

00:01:41.378 --> 00:01:44.722
You can return to its saved record from the next-step guide.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.153
Tour a future castle, its banners and its court.

00:01:49.273 --> 00:01:52.478
This is an art preview; it does not unlock the reward.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:02:01.799
Earlier recorded live AI footage also shows the house steward reading the ledger and checking sandbox transaction history.

00:02:01.919 --> 00:02:05.390
It has read only tools, and cannot authorize a payment.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:12.513
Those verified checks cover ledger and transaction history.

00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:16.534
Checking a specific household order still needs the sandbox insert.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:21.280
This twenty four second slot still needs the approved sandbox rehearsal.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:26.183
Show in app approval, the verified receipt, and the steward checking that same order.

00:02:26.303 --> 00:02:29.229
These missing outcomes have not been reconstructed.

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:33.923
The existing browser operator can resume after confirming the sandbox login.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.981
The forest is playable locally.

00:02:43.101 --> 00:02:46.375
Utility verification still needs a provider connection.

00:02:46.495 --> 00:02:50.198
This private review draft awaits its final sandbox insert.
